    "title": "Patrick Ball gets candid about debt, struggles and breakthrough with The Pitt - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sindhura Venkatesh ,\n1 hours ago The Pitt follows the story of doctors working in an emergency room, and the show also changed the life of actor Patrick Ball. He said that getting the role helped him pay off $80,000 in student debt within a few months. He described this as an important moment in his life and said he did not expect to clear the debt so soon. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
